<!--
    Bloodpetal: icons. Cut for this theme on a 24 grid in the language of forged iron: spiked terminals, fang chevrons,
    lozenges and round gems, nothing with a soft corner. None are traced from the game.
    IconMainMenu is the theme's own mark, a single petal (or drop) with a folded edge.
    Playnite's menu icons keep their icofont glyphs; only their hardcoded colors move onto theme brushes.
-->
